   377	def build_prompt(item, text, shown_views, universe, version):
   378	    """The request's two texts. The system text is the role; the user text is the category and how to read it, the subjects with the
   379	    theme list and the fiscal-year note, what to read out, the research reference, the questions open at the start of the item's day
   380	    with their takes lines, the research-group instruction, the item, the closing sentence and the end-of-request check."""
