   389	        f'[Category and how to read it] {category}. {blocks["what"]}',
   390	        f'[Subjects] The objects this item concerns: {", ".join(objects) or "(not labelled upstream)"}. For a candidate thesis about a company, object is its ticker; '
   391	        f'about a theme, choose an id from this list, or state what the matter is when none fits:\n{themes}'
   392	        + (f'\nFiscal-year note (a numeric thesis takes its year and due date from it):\n{fiscal}' if fiscal else ''),

